/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 148 0 R
/E (For the scope of this project evaluation, Toy Mode was formally chosen as the baseline implementation architecture. This operational environment provides the ideal sandbox to demonstrate dynamic emotion updates, deteriorating attention spans, and proactive voice loop orchestration without violating edge hardware restrictions.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
